  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        34.98200225830078,
        393.17059326171875,
        51.63800048828125
      ],
      "text": "Làm đềtrực tuyến tại: https://ielts-fighter.com/online-test.html\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        59.94099426269531,
        302.55078125,
        76.59700012207031
      ],
      "text": "Website tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.99369812011719,
        509.1739807128906,
        123.59259796142578
      ],
      "text": "recognised by various governments around the world. But unlike depression,\nloneliness has no recognised clinical form.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        136.5320587158203,
        99.86299896240234,
        156.033447265625
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.63470458984375,
        503.6040344238281,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "There's no available diagnosis or effective treatment and that's not likely to\nchange.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        128.42164611816406,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        228.1547088623047,
        517.7357788085938,
        286.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "I don't think so either. I was thinking we should start our presentation with an\nexample from our own experience. I like to talk about how lonely I was when I\nstarted university being away from home for the first time and all that.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        299.6110534667969,
        99.86299896240234,
        319.1124572753906
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        319.59368896484375,
        504.0905456542969,
        358.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Good idea. Everyone will be able to relate to that although a lot of students\nwere probably too embarrassed to admit to it.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        371.2520446777344,
        128.42164611816406,
        390.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        391.23468017578125,
        519.9613647460938,
        429.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Yeah. We could discuss ways of dealing with loneliness as well, like just talking\nto strangers.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        442.77203369140625,
        99.86299896240234,
        462.2734375
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        462.87469482421875,
        499.64849853515625,
        501.4736022949219
      ],
      "text": "Loads of studies have shown that interactions with shop assistants and bar\nstaff make people feel more optimistic and relaxed.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        514.4110107421875,
        128.42164611816406,
        533.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        534.3937377929688,
        504.7754821777344,
        573.1135864257812
      ],
      "text": "I don't know about that, but it must make people feel more connected with\ntheir community.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        586.0520629882812,
        99.86299896240234,
        605.553466796875
      ],
      "text": "DEV:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        606.0347290039062,
        519.140869140625,
        644.6336059570312
      ],
      "text": "True, although you need to be a certain kind of person to be able to just strike\nup a conversation.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        657.571044921875,
        128.42164611816406,
        677.0724487304688
      ],
      "text": "TAMARA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        677.6747436523438,
        515.7710571289062,
        736.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Good point. We should say something about solitude and how being alone\nand being lonely aren't the same thing. It's strange the way some people can't\nstand being by themselves while others love it.\n"
    }
  ]
